      "description": "The Nike App is your personal guide to all things Nike. ​​Become a Member ​​​and​​ get​​ exclusive ​access ​to ​the latest from Nike and Jordan. Shop innovative sport styles, curated clothing collections, trending sneakers and the latest streetwear. Unlock ​​Member Rewards, personalised ​​style advice and easy delivery and returns, all in one seamless shopping app.\n\nONLINE SHOPPING IS BETTER AS A MEMBER\nShop streetwear, shoes, gear and athletic apparel. Men's clothing, women's apparel and kids' sportswear are yours to unlock. Check out the latest styles, sneakers and sport essentials from Nike and Jordan.\n• Member profile: view activity, orders and purchase history. Buy streetwear, sportswear, sneakers and accessories with the Nike online shopping app.\n• Shopping app with Member Rewards: celebrate big moments like your birthday & Member anniversary.\n• Shop exclusive products: online shopping is better as a Member. Get first dibs on new, upcoming and seasonal releases dropping weekly. Shop Jordan, Air Max Dn8, P-6000, Nike Mercurial football boots, Vomero 18 and more.\n• Jordan Mode: shop the latest in Jordan clothing and sneakers, plus unlock exclusive content available only in Jordan Mode. Explore women's clothing, men's apparel and sneaker releases from Jordan.\n• Nike By You: shop and customise iconic Nike shoes with curated colour palettes and premium materials that match your style.\n\nSERVICES THAT CONNECT & GUIDE YOU\nShopping online and in-store is easier with the Nike App. Be the first to score the latest sneakers when you turn on notifications. Chat one-on-one with a Nike Expert for style advice. Take advantage of app-only shopping tools when visiting a Nike store.\n• Release notifications: never miss a sneaker drop. Jordan drops, the latest apparel, athlete collaborations, events and more are yours to discover when you turn on push notifications.\n• Easy in-store shopping: scan product barcodes in-store to quickly retrieve product details, find additional colourways and read reviews from fellow athletes.\n• Training & coaching for all: expert advice delivered by Nike athletes, coaches and personal trainers. Receive training tips with your Nike community from wherever you are.\n• Nike Experts: get sport and style advice from our Nike Experts. Chat in real time for guidance on all things Nike and Jordan.\n• Exclusive Nike Experiences: find Member-only events in your city and attend IRL or online. Join your Nike community.\n• Online shopping with athlete guidance: get exclusive access to expert advice, personalised shopping recommendations and Member-only perks.\n\nSTORIES THAT INSPIRE & INFORM YOU\nNike is more than a shopping app. Find in-depth stories spanning across sport and culture, delivered daily. Follow your favourite athletes, sports teams and products to get the most from the Nike App.\n• Member Home: explore new, curated Nike stories, refreshed daily.\n• Clothing trends & trainers: find new ways to wear your favourite Nike styles, streetwear, accessories and footwear.\n• Sportswear collections: sneakers, football boots, accessories, sportswear or workout clothing—learn what gear empowers the top Nike athletes.\n\nDiscover a shopping app with Member benefits and explore the latest from Nike and Jordan. Unlock exclusive apparel, style recommendations, in-person experiences and the newest sneaker releases.\n\nDownload today and experience shopping as a Nike Member.",
